  "result": "Perfect! All 226 tests pass. The overdue report feature is complete.\n\n**What was implemented:**\n- Added `overdueInvoices(invoices, asOf)` to new src/reports.js\n- Returns array of invoices with status 'issued' or 'partially_paid' whose dueDate is **before** asOf\n- Each invoice includes: { number, customerId, dueDate, daysOverdue, due }\n- `daysOverdue` calculated using daysBetween(dueDate, asOf)\n- `due` calculated using balanceDue() to account for partial payments\n- Sorted by daysOverdue descending (most overdue first)\n\n**Test coverage includes:**\n- Empty result when no invoices are overdue\n- Inclusion of invoices with dueDate before asOf\n- Exclusion of invoices with dueDate equal to or after asOf\n- Inclusion of issued and partially_paid invoices\n- Exclusion of draft and paid invoices\n- Invoice detail field correctness\n- DaysOverdue calculation accuracy\n- Due calculation with partial payments\n- Proper sorting (most overdue first)\n- Multiple customers and years\n- Complex invoices with discounts and VAT\n- Different payment terms (NET14, EOM, NET30)\n- No input mutation\n\nAll 226 tests pass (206 previous + 20 new).",
